      },
      "message": "Reference Model: Refine the register state of RRIDSCP\n\nCurrent implementation only returns RRIDSCP.stat=3 when desired\nRRIDSCP.op=0 (query) and given RRID is unimplemented. In fact, IOPMP\nreturns RRIDSCP.stat=3 every time SW writes unimplemented RRID, not just\nwhen SW writes RRIDSCP.op=0. This commit fixes this behavior.",
      "tree": {
